261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0165","question_id":"CQ-Q0165","citation_id":"smp-145e782a6d7e4307b1f6b41ddbff355a:12","title":"电商、团长、厂家、MCN看过来！ 达人商务工作台✨ ✅视/抖/快多平台资源归集 ✅达 人信息统一档案管理 ✅商务团队权限分配管控 ✅寄样物流全流程跟踪 ✅业绩数据可视化看板 一套软件搞定达 人对接全流程，告别Excel手工整理！","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686763690267689396","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686763690267689396","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0165","question_id":"CQ-Q0165","citation_id":"smp-145e782a6d7e4307b1f6b41ddbff355a:13","title":"Como criar um web app para gestão de campanhas com influenciadores | Koder.ai","raw_url":"https://koder.ai/pt/blog/app-gestao-campanhas-influenciadores","normalized_url":"https://koder.ai/pt/blog/app-gestao-campanhas-influenciadores","host":"koder.ai","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0165","question_id":"CQ-Q0165","citation_id":"smp-145e782a6d7e4307b1f6b41ddbff355a:14","title":"Influencer Platform MVP checklist — Step by Step 2026 - LaunchTry","raw_url":"https://launchtry.com/resources/mvp-checklist/influencer-platform","normalized_url":"https://launchtry.com/resources/mvp-checklist/influencer-platform","host":"launchtry.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0165","question_id":"CQ-Q0165","citation_id":"smp-145e782a6d7e4307b1f6b41ddbff355a:15","title":"软件开发到底有哪些流程？10个步骤一次讲。👉 很多人第一次做软件项目时，都会觉得：  “我把想法告诉开发人员，不就可以直接开始写代码了吗？”  其实，软件定制开发通常不是一上来就敲代码。无论是APP、","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7673054342689415076","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7673054342689415076","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OT